Package: tsco
Title: Two-Stage Conditional Odds Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Philip S.", family = "Boonstra", email = "phil@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements two-stage conditional odds (TSCO) models for
    ordinal outcomes. By default, individual-level proportional-odds stages
    are fitted using 'rms', while multinomial and grouped-count stages are
    fitted using 'VGAM'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/psboonstra/tsco
BugReports: https://github.com/psboonstra/tsco/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: 
    methods,
    utils,
    stats,
    rms,
    VGAM
